          "text": "Description: On December 25, 2009, at 20:30, a witness observed two rows of yellow lights that were moving. No particular noise was noticed during the observation that lasted about ten minutes. These lights quickly crossed the sky and disappeared towards the NE before the witness had a chance to take photographs. No other testimonies were collected. Based on the given description, the witness likely observed the passage of Thai lanterns.",
